@startuml custody
!include style.puml
hide stereotype
title One measurement, from published once to written once

skinparam nodesep 18
skinparam ranksep 30

component "Health Services\npublishes each point once,\nkeeps no history" as HS <<ext>>
component "deltas.log\nappend before anything else" as LOG <<watch>>
component "one window\n64 messages in flight" as WIN <<watch>>
component "unwritten\nkept until Health accepts" as UNW <<phone>>
component "Apple Health" as HK <<ext>>

HS -[#1DA34A]-> LOG : **cannot be re-asked**\nso this write comes first
LOG -[#1DA34A]-> WIN : **confirmed, or returned**\nthe radio says which
WIN -[#0A6ED1]-> UNW : **at-least-once**\nkind + exact span is the key
UNW -[#0A6ED1]-> HK : **written once**\nover the span it happened in

note bottom of LOG
  Survives the process, the reboot
  and a day with nobody listening.
end note

note bottom of WIN
  A window is forgotten only on a clean
  flush. A discard puts it back in front.
end note

note bottom of UNW
  The watch has already forgotten it,
  so a sealed store must not drop it.
end note

note right of HK
  The daily absolute never arrives here.
  It drives the screens and the audit,
  and having it write too is what put
  the same steps in twice.
end note
@enduml
